15 — Our Google AI Studio development strategy
Google AI Studio is going to be our primary development environment.

Google AI Studio Build mode currently supports full-stack web app development, including a React frontend, server-side Node.js runtime, Firebase integrations, secrets management, GitHub synchronization and deployment workflows. That makes it a reasonable environment for building Daywell incrementally rather than only prototyping its UI. 
Google AI























